---
// FinalCTA.astro - Final call to action + footer
---

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section id="aanmelden" class="relative py-24 md:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background gradient -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0F0F23] via-[#1A1A3E] to-[#7C3AED]/30"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#7C3AED]/20 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-black uppercase text-white animate-fade-in-up">
      Klaar Om Te Lopen?
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-100">
      Geen inschrijfgeld. Geen verplichtingen. Geen contract van 12 maanden waar je spijt van krijgt. Gewoon opdagen en lopen.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-200">
      <a href="#" class="btn-cta text-xl px-12 py-5 inline-block">
        Ik Ben Erbij
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-300">
      Eerste run is altijd gratis. Altijd. Verslaving aan hardlopen is voor eigen risico.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Disclaimer -->
<div class="bg-[#0A0A1A] py-5 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs text-muted/60 leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-muted/80">Disclaimer:</strong> Just Screw It is een volledig fictief hardloopteam, gemaakt puur voor de fun.
      Alle namen, foto's, testimonials en trainingsschema's zijn verzonnen. Eventuele overeenkomsten met bestaande hardloopgroepen berusten op toeval
      — al zouden we het niet erg vinden als iemand dit echt opricht.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="bg-[#0A0A1A] border-t border-white/10 py-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Just Screw It. Alle rechten voorbehouden.
    </p>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
      <!-- Instagram -->
      <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram" class="text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
          <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
          <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <!-- Strava -->
      <a href="#" aria-label="Strava" class="text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M15.387 17.944l-2.089-4.116h-3.065L15.387 24l5.15-10.172h-3.066m-7.008-5.599l2.836 5.598h4.172L10.463 0l-7 13.828h4.169"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <!-- WhatsApp -->
      <a href="#" aria-label="WhatsApp" class="text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Made by CSBN -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs text-muted/50">
      Gemaakt door <a href="https://csbn.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-light/60 hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">CSBN</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
